          "description": "Run fhir-harness's `fhir-cache-seed-npm` with smart-base's publisher-site rules (`SMART_PUBLISHER_SITE_REPOS`), so `smart.who.int.*` packages can also be read from WHO's published-site repository, each fetch verified against the tarball's own package.json. All other sources and checks are the seeder's.",
          "install": {
